<h2 style="text-align:center">SIZE GUIDE</h2>
<p class="sub" style="text-align:center">FIND YOUR PERFECT FIT</p>
<p>Find your perfect fit with our sizing chart.</p>
<p>Some ring designs are adjustable at the back, making them ideal for gifting or if you're unsure of the exact size.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">BANGLES & RINGS</h3>
<p style="margin-top:8px">Take a bangle or ring that fits you comfortably and measure the inner diameter using a ruler. Match it with the size guide above.</p>
<table style="width:100%;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px"><tr><th>Size</th><th>Inner Dia (mm)</th></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>16.5</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>17.3</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>18.1</td></tr></table>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">BRACELETS</h3>
<p style="margin-top:8px">Measure your wrist just above the wrist bone and choose the size range that feels most comfortable.</p>
<p style="margin-top:16px">Need help choosing the right size? Contact us on <a href="https://instagram.com/newds.co">Instagram</a> and we'll be happy to assist you.</p>
</section>
